      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 3136817844899840
    m_Localized: Welcome to Flick Curling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482752
    m_Localized: In Flick Curling you flick go stones to get them closer to the centre
      of the house than your opponent's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482753
    m_Localized: You and your opponent take turns throwing one stone each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482756
    m_Localized: When the end is over, you score one point for each of your stones
      closer to the centre than your opponent's closest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482757
    m_Localized: Now let's see how to throw a stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482758
    m_Localized: Below the min line, drag left or right on the left of the stone
      to change the direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482759
    m_Localized: Drag up or down on the right of the stone to set the power, and
      let go to throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677056
    m_Localized: Touch above the min line to aim straight at that spot. Drag and
      the aim follows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677058
    m_Localized: Tap to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677059
    m_Localized: Skip the tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677060
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677061
    m_Localized: Skip the tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677062
    m_Localized: It won't be shown again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677063
    m_Localized: Keep going
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677064
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677065
    m_Localized: Tutorial complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677066
    m_Localized: Now take on the AI and players online!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677067
    m_Localized: Let's go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3162040900177920
    m_Localized: A stone that doesn't cross the min line, or goes all the way past
      the out line, doesn't count and is removed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3994885692510208
    m_Localized: Your turn now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3994885776396288
    m_Localized: The side that throws first starts with a bonus guard in front of
      the house, to make up for the other side having the last stone. Now beat the
      AI!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579859
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579860
    m_Localized: Direction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579861
    m_Localized: Below the min line, drag left or right on the left of the stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579862
    m_Localized: Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579863
    m_Localized: Drag up or down on the right of the stone. The longer the pull,
      the harder the throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579864
    m_Localized: Throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579865
    m_Localized: Let go of the power finger to throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579866
    m_Localized: Quick aim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579867
    m_Localized: Touch above the min line to aim right there. Drag and the aim follows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579868
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579869
    m_Localized: Move the pulling finger to the left of the stone and it won't throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579888
    m_Localized: Turn Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579890
    m_Localized: Before the match, the order for the first end is decided. A target
      is placed somewhere on the sheet and both players throw one stone at it at
      the same time. The other's stone shows see-through, and the two never meet.
      Two players on one device take turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172798029824
    m_Localized: Remove Ads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304512
    m_Localized: Ads have been removed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304513
    m_Localized: Owned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304514
    m_Localized: Pending
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304515
    m_Localized: 'Can''t reach the store.

      Please try again later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304516
    m_Localized: 'Your purchase is waiting for approval.

      It will be applied
      once approved.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304517
    m_Localized: 'The purchase didn''t go through.

      Please try again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4163776012013568
