      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4163776070733824
    m_Localized: Your purchases have been restored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4163776070733825
    m_Localized: 'Couldn''t restore your purchases.

      Please try again later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4168660052529152
    m_Localized: Opponent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4181914246107136
    m_Localized: Takeout!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4181914363547648
    m_Localized: Double Takeout!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4181914363547649
    m_Localized: Triple Takeout!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183663379927040
    m_Localized: Vibration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183663468007424
    m_Localized: On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183663468007425
    m_Localized: Off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4260592254636032
    m_Localized: Throw at the target!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4260592384659456
    m_Localized: "Waiting for the opponent\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4275301687152640
    m_Localized: 'A match starts with the turn order shot: both sides throw one stone
      at this target at the same time, and whoever gets closer throws last.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4351939456192512
    m_Localized: Items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4351939523301376
    m_Localized: Giant Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4351939523301377
    m_Localized: Mini Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4351939523301378
    m_Localized: Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4351939523301379
    m_Localized: '{team} got a {item}!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4396563457560576
    m_Localized: Item Mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4396563583389696
    m_Localized: Getting items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4396563583389697
    m_Localized: When one of your stones touches an orb of your colour, you get an
      item; you find out which as you get it. An opponent's stone breaks it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4396563583389698
    m_Localized: Using items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4396563583389699
    m_Localized: You can hold two. On your turn, tap one to put it on the stone you're
      about to throw, one a turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4406000448622592
    m_Localized: Items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4406000457011200
    m_Localized: Giant Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4406000457011201
    m_Localized: Your stone grows {giant} times as big, for as long as it stays on
      the sheet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4406000457011202
    m_Localized: Mini Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4406000457011203
    m_Localized: 'Your stone shrinks to {mini} times its size: it slips through gaps
      and is hard to hit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4406000457011204
    m_Localized: Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4406000457011205
    m_Localized: It goes off the first time it hits another stone, pushing every
      other stone nearby away. If it hits none, it fizzles out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4415052822007808
    m_Localized: Magnet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4415052826202112
    m_Localized: Protractor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4415052830396416
    m_Localized: Magnet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4415052830396417
    m_Localized: While it moves, it pulls the stones around it and drags them along.
      Once it stops, it's over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4415052830396418
    m_Localized: Protractor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4415052830396419
    m_Localized: Shows where the aim line goes after it meets a wall or a stone.
      Only on your screen, until you throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859292528642
    m_Localized: Item respawn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859292528643
    m_Localized: Orbs taken or broken turn up somewhere else once both sides have
      thrown; each new end puts them all out afresh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859292528644
    m_Localized: Playing an End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859292528645
    m_Localized: Turns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859292528646
    m_Localized: "\u2022<indent=1em>Each end starts with a bonus guard stone in front
      of the house for the side going first.</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Starting
      with that side, Black and White throw one stone at a time, {shots:plural:{}
      stone|{} stones} each; the side going second throws the last one.</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>You
      have {seconds} seconds a turn. When the fuse over the min line burns out, you
      lose that stone.</indent>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4566859296722944
    m_Localized: Scoring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859296722945
    m_Localized: "\u2022<indent=1em>Of the stones touching the house, only the side
      with the one closest to the centre scores.</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>It scores
      a point for each of its stones closer than the opponent's closest.</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>If
      the house is empty or the closest stones are level, nobody scores (a blank
      end).</indent>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859296722946
    m_Localized: Next end, and the result
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4566859296722947
    m_Localized: "\u2022<indent=1em>The side that scored goes first in the next end.
      After a blank end, going second passes to the other side.</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>The
      higher total after the last end wins.</indent>\n\u2022<indent=1em>Level, extra
      ends are played until one side wins.</indent>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271452409856
    m_Localized: Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271452409857
    m_Localized: Goal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271452409858
    m_Localized: Flick your stones closer to the centre of the house than your opponent's.
      After deciding who goes first, you play {ends:plural:{} end|{} ends}, and the
      higher total score wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4604271460798464
    m_Localized: The sheet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798466
    m_Localized: Launch spot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798467
    m_Localized: Every stone is thrown from the middle at the bottom of the sheet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798468
    m_Localized: Min line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798469
    m_Localized: A thrown stone has to get all the way past this line; one that doesn't
      is void and removed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798470
    m_Localized: House
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798471
    m_Localized: The rings at the top. Points are counted from the stones touching
      the house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798472
    m_Localized: Side walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798473
    m_Localized: Stones may bounce off the side walls; the walls beside the out line
      soak them up instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4604271460798474
    m_Localized: Target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734080
    m_Localized: Out line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734081
    m_Localized: The line behind the house. Any stone all the way past it is out
      and removed, even one knocked there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734082
    m_Localized: Throw at the target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734083
    m_Localized: Closer goes second
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734084
    m_Localized: Whoever stops closer to the target's centre goes second, with the
      advantage of throwing the end's last stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734085
    m_Localized: No record, or level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4609059170734086
    m_Localized: A stone short of the min line or out has no record. If the two records
      are level, it's decided at random.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4643155045437440
    m_Localized: Terms of Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4643155045437441
    m_Localized: Privacy Policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4661804745543680
    m_Localized: Ad Privacy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103522758656
    m_Localized: Friend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701696
    m_Localized: Create Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701697
    m_Localized: Enter Code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701698
    m_Localized: Room Code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701699
    m_Localized: Copy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701700
    m_Localized: Share
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701701
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701702
    m_Localized: "Opening a room\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103564701703
    m_Localized: Waiting for your friend {time}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4750103573090304
    m_Localized: Code copied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090305
    m_Localized: Nobody came, so the room has closed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090306
    m_Localized: Couldn't open a room. Please try again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090307
    m_Localized: Your friend's room code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090308
    m_Localized: 6-character code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090309
    m_Localized: Join
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090310
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090311
    m_Localized: "Joining\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090312
    m_Localized: Enter the 6-character code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090313
    m_Localized: No room with that code. Please check it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090314
    m_Localized: That room's match has already started
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090315
    m_Localized: Couldn't join. Please try again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4750103573090316
    m_Localized: 'Let''s play Flick Curling! Room code: {code}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4750103573090317
    m_Localized: Your friend has left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4751954615914496
    m_Localized: If you leave now, your friend wins this match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8690121547108352
    m_Localized: '{name} Last Turn'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 8707339966140416
    m_Localized: You and your friend have different versions. Please both update
      to the latest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8707340058415104
    m_Localized: 'A new version is out!

      Online matches need the latest version'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8707340058415105
    m_Localized: Update
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9425486662782976
    m_Localized: Flick Curling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137851909820416
    m_Localized: Turn Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981184
    m_Localized: The side the coin shows throws last in end 1!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981185
    m_Localized: Toss the coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981186
    m_Localized: Coin toss result
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981187
    m_Localized: Turn Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981188
    m_Localized: Coin toss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981189
    m_Localized: Before the match, a coin is tossed for the first end's order. One
      face shows a black stone, the other a white one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981190
    m_Localized: Its side goes second
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10137852085981191
    m_Localized: 'The side whose stone comes up goes second: it throws the end''s
      last stone, the better place to be.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10163382965424128
    m_Localized: '{icon} You go first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 10163383124807680
    m_Localized: '{icon} You go second.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 10165108531449856
    m_Localized: 'A match starts by deciding the turn order: a coin is tossed, and
      the side whose stone comes up throws last.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10167814247600128
    m_Localized: Extra {n}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
